.TH tunumfmt 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tunumfmt \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tunumfmt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tunumfmt ?-mode to|from? ?-to si|iec? ?-from si|iec|auto? ?-precision N? ?file?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tunumfmt command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tunumfmt. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tunumfmt(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tunumfmt.tcl ...
.fi
